"row": 2, "col": "OK", "at": 1}], "type": "table"}, {"x": 150, "y": 520, "w": 780, "h": 170, "title": "Split Info 的懲罰", "col": "PUR", "at": 1, "body": ["Marital 切 3 塊 → 1.522", "Income 切 2 塊 → 0.971"], "bs": 26, "type": "card"}, {"x": 990, "y": 520, "w": 780, "h": 170, "title": "平手改選 Income？", "col": "B", "at": 2, "body": ["Gini 的樹 → 也是 2 次分割、3 片葉子", "（程式驗證）"], "bs": 26, "type": "card"}, {"y": 750, "items": [{"s": "平手規則會改變結果 → 報告一定要寫", "col": "BAD", "at": 3}], "size": 28, "type": "chips"}], "desc": "Gini＝資訊增益：Marital 根，4 分割 6 葉；Gain Ratio：Income 根，2 分割 3 葉；Split Info 懲罰三路的 Marital；若平手改選 Income，Gini 樹也會變成 2 分割 3 葉（程式驗證）", "ref": "PART03 p93–97", "chapter": "比較：三種指標與平手規則", "tag": "比較", "tagCol": "PUR"}, {"id": "code1", "title": "(d) 程式（一）：從零寫 Hunt's，印出每個節點的分數", "els": [{"x": 120, "y": 200, "w": 930, "h": 680, "title": "a2_hunt.py（核心，簡化）", "size": 19, "cells": [{"code": ["def score(D, kids, classes, crit):", "    I = gini if crit == \"gini\" else entropy", "    w = sum(len(k)/n * I(counts(k)) for k in kids)", "    delta = I(counts(D)) - w", "    split_info = -sum(len(k)/n * log2(len(k)/n) ...)", "    if crit == \"gain_ratio\": return delta / split_info", "    return delta"], "at": 1}, {"code": ["hunt(loan, [\"HomeOwner\",\"Marital\",\"Income\"],", "     [\"No\",\"Yes\"], [\"Income\"], \"gain_ratio\")"], "at": 2}], "type": "code"}, {"x": 1080, "y": 200, "w": 720, "h": 680, "title": "實際輸出（節錄，換行排版）", "size": 17, "cells": [{"code": ["# loan data | gain_ratio"], "out": ["[root] n=10 counts=(7, 3)", "HomeOwner multi", "  delta=0.1916 SplitInfo=0.8813", "  score=0.2174", "Marital multi", "  delta=0.2813 SplitInfo=1.5219", "  score=0.1848", "Income <=97.5", "  delta=0.2813 SplitInfo=0.9710", "  score=0.2897", "=> SPLIT on Income", "   (gain_ratio = 0.2897)"], "at": 3, "oat": [3, 1]}], "type": "code"}], "desc": "a2_hunt.py：score() 同時算 I(children)、Δ、Split Info、GR；hunt() 遞迴；實際輸出節錄（貸款資料 gain_ratio 根節點）", "ref": "PART03 p98–104、p136", "chapter": "(d) 程式：從零寫的 Python 版", "tag": "實際執行", "tagCol": "CY"}, {"id": "code2", "title": "(d) 程式（二）：用 scikit-learn 交叉檢查", "els": [{"x": 120, "y": 200, "w": 900, "h": 680, "title": "a2_sklearn.py", "size": 19, "cells": [{"code": ["from sklearn.tree import DecisionTreeClassifier, export_text", "X = pd.get_dummies(loan[[\"HomeOwner\",\"Marital\",\"Income\"]])", "t = DecisionTreeClassifier(criterion=\"gini\",", "                           random_state=0).fit(X, y)", "print(export_text(t, feature_names=list(X.columns)))"], "at": 0}, {"code": ["# loan | criterion=gini | leaves=4 depth=3 acc=1.00"], "out": ["|--- Marital_Married <= 0.50", "|   |--- HomeOwner_No <= 0.50", "|   |   |--- class: No", "|   |--- HomeOwner_No >  0.50", "|   |   |--- Income <= 77.50", "|   |   |   |--- class: No", "|   |   |--- Income >  77.50", "|   |   |   |--- class: Yes", "|--- Marital_Married >  0.50", "|   |--- class: No"], "at": 2, "oat": [2, 1]}], "type": "code"}, {"x": 1060, "y": 200, "w": 710, "h": 250, "title": "scikit-learn 的限制", "col": "BAD", "at": 1, "body": ["只吃數字 → 先 one-hot", "每次只切兩邊（CART）", "沒有 Gain Ratio"], "bs": 26, "type": "card"}, {"x": 1060, "y": 480, "w": 710, "h": 180, "title": "criterion=\"entropy\" 也一樣", "col": "A", "at": 3, "body": ["4 片葉子、正確率 1.00（實際執行）"], "bs": 24, "type": "card"}, {"x": 1060, "y": 690, "w": 710, "h": 190, "title": "報告的分工", "col": "OK", "at": 4, "body": ["自己寫的程式：(a)(b)(c)", "scikit-learn：對照組・plot_tree 畫圖"], "bs": 24, "type": "card"}], "desc": "DecisionTreeClassifier(criterion=\"gini\"/\"entropy\")，類別先 one-hot；只做二元分割、沒有 Gain Ratio；貸款資料實際輸出：Marital_Married → HomeOwner_No → Income ≤ 77.50，4 片葉子、正確率 1.00", "ref": "PART03 p134（CART）", "chapter": "(d) 程式：scikit-learn 交叉檢查", "tag": "實際執行", "tagCol": "CY"}, {"id": "check", "title": "作業二交件檢查清單", "els": [{"x": 160, "y": 210, "w": 1600, "size": 27, "rh": 78, "gap": 8, "items": [{"s": "☐ 確認「兩份資料」（Tronclass）：顧客 20 筆＋貸款 10 筆？", "at": 1, "col": "BAD"}, {"s": "☐ 設定：多路分割・切點取中點・平手規則・ID 不當候選", "at": [1, 4]}, {"s": "☐ 兩份資料 × (a) Gini (b) 資訊增益 (c) Gain Ratio：每節點分數表＋每種一棵樹", "at": 2, "col": "A"}, {"s": "☐ (d) 程式：每節點分數輸出＋樹的圖形，與手算對照", "at": 3}, {"s": "☐ 討論：三種指標的樹哪裡不同、為什麼（Split Info、平手）", "at": [3, 3]}, {"s": "☐ 附錄：程式碼（可附壓縮檔或連結）→ 11/11 前上傳", "at": [3, 6], "col": "OK"}], "type": "bullets"}], "desc": "兩份資料 × (a)(b)(c) 手算、(d) 程式結果與圖形、設定與規則、附錄程式碼", "ref": "PART03 p136", "chapter": "作業二交件檢查清單", "tag": "作業二 11/11", "tagCol": "B"}, {"id": "mistakes", "title": "常見誤區", "els": [{"x": 160, "y": 215, "w": 1600, "size": 30, "gap": 14, "items": [{"s": "連續屬性每個值長一支（要找切點、切兩邊）", "at": 1, "col": "BAD"}, {"s": "切點只試一個（9 個中點都要算）", "at": 2, "col": "BAD"}, {"s": "平手不寫規則 → 別人重算對不起來", "at": 3, "col": "BAD"}, {"s": "Gain Ratio 的分子用 Gini（要用資訊增益）", "at": 4, "col": "BAD"}, {"s": "只交 scikit-learn：沒有 Gain Ratio、只有二元分割", "at": 5, "col": "BAD"}], "type": "bullets"}], "desc": "五個紅色警示", "ref": "", "chapter": "常見誤區"}, {"id": "quiz", "title": "小測驗", "els": [{"y": 215, "qs": [{"q": "Q1　85 與 90 之間的切點？", "a": "(85 ＋ 90) ÷ 2 ＝ 87.5", "qi": 1, "ai": 2}, {"q": "Q2　資訊增益平手，為什麼 GR 選 Income？", "a": "Split Info：Marital 1.522 > Income 0.971", "qi": 3, "ai": 4}, {"q": "Q3　scikit-learn 能做 (c) Gain Ratio 嗎？", "a": "不行：沒有 Gain Ratio → 自己寫程式", "qi": 5, "ai": 6}], "type": "quiz"}], "desc": "三題，倒數暫停後揭曉", "ref": "", "chapter": "小測驗"}, {"id": "recap", "title": "重點回顧", "els": [{"x": 160, "y": 210, "w": 1600, "size": 28, "gap": 12, "items": [{"s": "連續屬性：排序 → 中點 → 掃描；最佳切點 97.5", "at": 1}, {"s": "Gini／資訊增益：Marital（平手）→ 4 分割；Gain Ratio：Income → 2 分割", "at": 2}, {"s": "平手規則會改變結果 → 報告一定要寫", "at": [2, 4], "col": "B"}, {"s": "程式：自寫做 (a)(b)(c)；scikit-learn 當對照", "at": 3}], "type": "bullets"}, {"x": 160, "y": 720, "w": 1600, "h": 110, "title": "方法示範：請自己算、自己寫・11/11 截止", "ts": 32, "col": "B", "align": "center", "at": 4, "type": "card"}], "desc": "回顧＋方法示範提醒", "ref": "", "chapter": "重點回顧"}]